# SALMAH LUXE SHOP

## Mobile Shopping Application

### Course

BIT4107 – Mobile Application Development

### Student Name

Salmah Bakari BIT/2025/31661

### Technology Stack

* React Native
* Expo
* JavaScript
* React Navigation
