---

# 1. INTRODUCTION

Mobile commerce has become an important part of modern business operations. Many small fashion businesses rely heavily on social media platforms such as WhatsApp and Instagram to market and sell products. However, customers often face difficulties browsing products in an organized manner.

The Salmah Luxe Shop mobile application was developed as a simple fashion shopping platform that enables users to view available products, add items to a shopping cart, and place orders through WhatsApp.

The application demonstrates practical mobile application development concepts including navigation, user interfaces, user authentication screens, state management, and integration with external applications.

---

# 2. PROBLEM STATEMENT

Many small fashion businesses do not have dedicated mobile applications for displaying products and receiving customer orders.

Customers are often required to browse through social media posts manually, making product discovery difficult and reducing the overall shopping experience.

This project seeks to provide a simple mobile solution that allows customers to browse products, manage a shopping cart, and initiate purchases through WhatsApp.

---

# 3. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

## Main Objective

To design and develop a mobile shopping application for a fashion store using React Native and Expo.

## Specific Objectives

* To create a user-friendly mobile application interface.
* To implement user registration and login screens.
* To display fashion products in an organized manner.
* To allow users to add products to a shopping cart.
* To enable order placement through WhatsApp.
* To implement profile management functionality.
* To demonstrate practical mobile application development skills.

---

# 4. PROJECT SCOPE

The project focuses on the development of a mobile shopping application prototype.

The application includes:

* User registration
* User login
* Product viewing
* Cart management
* Checkout functionality
* WhatsApp integration
* User profile management
* Logout functionality

The project does not include:

* Online payment integration
* Cloud database storage
* Real-time inventory management
* Administrative dashboard

---

# 5. SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS

## Software Requirements

* Visual Studio Code
* Node.js
* Expo CLI
* Expo Go
* Git
* GitHub

## Hardware Requirements

* Laptop/Desktop Computer
* Android Smartphone
* Internet Connection

---

# 6. TECHNOLOGY STACK

## React Native

React Native was used to develop the mobile application because it supports cross-platform development and enables rapid mobile application creation using JavaScript.

## Expo

Expo was used to simplify development, testing, and deployment processes.

## React Navigation

React Navigation was used to implement screen-to-screen navigation throughout the application.

## GitHub

GitHub was used for source code management and version control.

---

# 7. SYSTEM DESIGN

## Application Flow

User launches application

↓

Login Screen

↓

Registration Screen (for new users)

↓

Home Screen

↓

Product Selection

↓

Cart

↓

Checkout

↓

WhatsApp Order

↓

Profile Screen

↓

Logout

---

# 8. SYSTEM FEATURES

## 8.1 Login Screen

The login screen allows users to enter their credentials before accessing the application.

Features:

* Email field
* Password field
* Login button
* Registration link

Benefits:

* Provides controlled access to the application.
* Introduces users to authentication workflows.

---

## 8.2 Registration Screen

The registration screen allows new users to create an account.

Features:

* Name field
* Email field
* Password field
* Registration button

Benefits:

* Allows new users to join the platform.
* Demonstrates form handling functionality.

---

## 8.3 Home Screen

The home screen displays available fashion products.

Features:

* Product cards
* Product images
* Product names
* Product prices

Benefits:

* Enables users to browse products.
* Provides a user-friendly shopping experience.

---

## 8.4 Cart Screen

The cart screen stores products selected by the user.

Features:

* Product list
* Quantity management
* Total calculation

Benefits:

* Allows users to review their selections before checkout.

---

## 8.5 Checkout Screen

The checkout screen prepares order information.

Features:

* Order summary
* WhatsApp checkout button

Benefits:

* Simplifies communication between customer and seller.

---

## 8.6 Profile Screen

The profile screen displays user information.

Features:

* User details
* Logout button

Benefits:

* Improves user account management.

---

